# Build steps plugins ship.
#
# A plugin that needs something apt does not carry (a tarball, a model, a
# runtime) ships `docker/build.d/<plugin>.sh` from its own templates. The
# Dockerfile runs every `*.sh` here in name order, before the application
# code is copied in, so the step's layer caches across source changes.
#
# Keep this directory in the build context: the Dockerfile copies it
# wholesale and runs whatever it finds.
